  "id": "sausage-and-bean-puff-pastry-pies",
  "name": "Sausage and Bean Puff Pastry Pies",
  "subtitle": "Golden individual pies with a savory bean and sausage filling",
  "description": "Crisp puff pastry parcels filled with saucy beans, sliced sausage, spring onions, oregano, and cheddar.",
